{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:hsvg:2.0:schema:capability:ai",
  "title": "HyperSVG 2.0 capability ai: AI sources and characters",
  "description": "AI sources for character seats under addons.ai.seats of the experience (D31), and the call ai.ask asking such a seat for a typed answer | needs the ai grant for an AI source; the built-in source (at most 64 picked questions with written answers, then the call's fallback) always works; a place that offers them as buttons shows at most 6 (quickReplies) | steering is the lowest of the seat's steer and the source's grant: none, ask, guided, open; open is refused when the host profile's audience is children | an answer is plain text of at most maxLength (at most 500) or one of at most 32 declared option ids; it is checked before any write; markup, actions, events, addresses and code are refused; a late, cancelled or failed answer uses the fallback; at most limits.perMinute (1..20) requests run per minute | AI answers and every value derived from them stay in the scene's moment values and bindings (E-AI-FLOW) | the answer arrives as the event ai:answered {answer, source, seat} at the asking block; a reaction to it sets a moment value; source says where it came from: ai, builtIn or fallback",
  "$comment": "Generated by docs/spec-2.0-work/tools/schema/make-schemas.mjs from the spec/2.0 machine files. Do not edit.",
